    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts Of The Past follows the fate of nine people hired to find a map that unlocks the secret of eternal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story based RPG, Tales of the Lost, will be shown from a different character's point of view across numerous episodes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story based adventure:</strong> Follow the adventures of the company of nine as they embark on a dangerous quest; will they find external life or lose their own?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/2f3a2facee18b67c7ae28b40ba67aa00.poster.avif?t=1752568272\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/2f3a2facee18b67c7ae28b40ba67aa00.webm?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/2f3a2facee18b67c7ae28b40ba67aa00.mp4?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters with unique skills</strong>: The skills of a miner, hunter, archer and even a pirate will be playable (depending on the episode).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/b3a8a0ae01233e0edc39d7f7e0ca1041.poster.avif?t=1752568272\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/b3a8a0ae01233e0edc39d7f7e0ca1041.webm?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/b3a8a0ae01233e0edc39d7f7e0ca1041.mp4?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based battles: </strong>Face off against bandits, guards and monsters that the world had forgotten.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/bdb9423dea5981525c0ae45161942ec4.poster.avif?t=1752568272\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/bdb9423dea5981525c0ae45161942ec4.webm?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/bdb9423dea5981525c0ae45161942ec4.mp4?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts Of The Past follows the fate of nine people hired to find a map that unlocks the secret of eternal life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story based RPG, Tales of the Lost, will be shown from a different character's point of view across numerous episodes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story based adventure:</strong> Follow the adventures of the company of nine as they embark on a dangerous quest; will they find external life or lose their own?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/2f3a2facee18b67c7ae28b40ba67aa00.poster.avif?t=1752568272\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/2f3a2facee18b67c7ae28b40ba67aa00.webm?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/2f3a2facee18b67c7ae28b40ba67aa00.mp4?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters with unique skills</strong>: The skills of a miner, hunter, archer and even a pirate will be playable (depending on the episode).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/b3a8a0ae01233e0edc39d7f7e0ca1041.poster.avif?t=1752568272\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/b3a8a0ae01233e0edc39d7f7e0ca1041.webm?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/b3a8a0ae01233e0edc39d7f7e0ca1041.mp4?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based battles: </strong>Face off against bandits, guards and monsters that the world had forgotten.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/bdb9423dea5981525c0ae45161942ec4.poster.avif?t=1752568272\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/bdb9423dea5981525c0ae45161942ec4.webm?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414690/extras/bdb9423dea5981525c0ae45161942ec4.mp4?t=1752568272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
